            "review_title": "Review at Caliz wine bar",
            "review_text": "Michela G\n8 contributions\n0\nExcellent wine and a nice selection of dishes to accompany\nMar 2026 • Family\nBeautiful and well-kept industrial environment, the owner is very knowledgeable and guides you on the choice of wines, really very varied list with labels from all over the world, we just wanted to drink a glass of wine and we ended up drinking three and eating here\nSpectacular cheese platter and we tasted the equally good Japanese meat. \nHighly recommended!\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten March 26, 2026",
