            "review_title": "Review at Caliz wine bar",
            "review_text": "Y&SFOOD!\nBangkok, Thailand1110 contributions\n0\nBites & Wines\nOct 2025 • Solo\nThe evening at CALIZ WINE BAR - @caliz.winebar - was an impeccable blend of modern elegance and culinary enjoyment. The philosophy here is clear: a thoughtful marriage of a curated wine selection with an authentic Spanish-oriented menu.\n\nThe industrial-chic interior, softened by warm, intimate lighting, creates a wonderfully relaxed yet upscale setting: perfect for a memorable night out.\n\nEach plate presented was a testament to the kitchen’s grilling skills, where fresh, high-quality ingredients were transformed into robust, traditional flavors that were both rustic and refined. They paired exquisitely with the chosen wines.\n\nCaliz is more than just a wine bar; it’s an essential destination in Da Nang for anyone who appreciates the passionate flavors of Spain, either for a casual and friendly gathering as well as for a more private encounter. An absolutely delightful experience from start to finish.\n\n⭐️ NEW ENTRY IN THE Y&SFOOD! DA NANG DINING GUIDE 2025.\nRead more\nWritten October 18, 2025",
